<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>HoopSync Support</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            background: #f5f5f7;
            color: #1d1d1f;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 60px 24px;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }

        h1 {
            margin-top: 0;
            font-size: 36px;
        }

        h2 {
            margin-top: 32px;
        }

        p, li {
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        a {
            color: #007aff;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">

            <h1>HoopSync Support</h1>

            <p>
                Welcome to HoopSync Support. HoopSync helps basketball
                coaches and players plan, train, track progress, and
                improve their game.
            </p>

            <h2>Need Help?</h2>

            <p>
                If you need assistance with HoopSync, have found a bug,
                or have a question about the app, please contact our
                support team.
            </p>

            <p>
                <strong>Email:</strong>
                <a href="mailto:YOUR-SUPPORT-EMAIL">
                    hoopsyncconnect@gmail.com
                </a>
            </p>

            <h2>Account & Login</h2>

            <p>
                If you are having trouble signing in, creating an account,
                or accessing your HoopSync account, contact support and
                include the email address associated with your account.
            </p>

            <h2>Subscriptions & Purchases</h2>

            <p>
                For questions about HoopSync subscriptions or purchases,
                please contact support. Apple manages App Store billing
                and payment processing for purchases made through the
                App Store.
            </p>

            <h2>Bug Reports</h2>

            <p>
                If something isn't working correctly, please contact us
                and include a description of the problem and, if possible,
                the steps that caused it.
            </p>

            <h2>Coaches</h2>

            <p>
                HoopSync provides tools for coaches to plan practices,
                organize teams, draw plays, and manage basketball
                activities.
            </p>

            <h2>Players</h2>

            <p>
                HoopSync provides tools for players to create workouts,
                track training, study plays, and work toward improving
                their game.
            </p>

            <h2>Contact Us</h2>

            <p>
                For any questions or support requests, please contact us
                at the email address above.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            © 2026 HoopSync. All rights reserved.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
